                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "87a9bc47-7aef-4324-a13c-7df464c9481f",
                        "source_entry_id": "e6d5bd08-3a48-3696-8555-c46166efefc7",
                        "target_lang_word": "parenthesis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "parenthesis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97e19b41-fd12-38b3-854c-18e7061f54e1",
                                        "entry_id": "51d8ab5f-448d-3d45-ab21-48ca146d6d60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A clause, phrase or word which is inserted (usually for explanation or amplification) into a passage which is already grammatically complete, and usually marked off with brackets, commas or dashes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ba475e1-585b-4c18-897d-49478e8c5a20",
                                                "sense_id": "97e19b41-fd12-38b3-854c-18e7061f54e1",
                                                "text": "How expressive this little parenthesis: \"Sakuntalâ makes a chiding gesture with her finger\"!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06e51e09-b8bb-3137-aec8-2e3cdfbfdb96",
                                        "entry_id": "51d8ab5f-448d-3d45-ab21-48ca146d6d60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Either of a pair of brackets, especially (mainly US) round brackets, ( and ) (used to enclose parenthetical material in a text)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdd4952b-44d1-49c7-a626-6dab39384da6",
                                                "sense_id": "06e51e09-b8bb-3137-aec8-2e3cdfbfdb96",
                                                "text": "There be five manner of points and divisions most used among cunning men; the which if they be well used, make the sentence very light and easy to be understood, both to the reader and hearer: and they be these, virgil,—come,—parenthesis,—plain point,—interrogative[…] it is a slender stroke leaning forward, betokening a little short rest, without any perfectness yet of sentence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4be00a79-ca18-4e99-80be-d9b6c9a16d59",
                                                "sense_id": "06e51e09-b8bb-3137-aec8-2e3cdfbfdb96",
                                                "text": "Whoever introduced the several points, it seems that a full-point, a point called come, answering to our colon-point, a point called virgil answering to our comma-point, the parenthesis-points and interrogative-point, were used at the close of the fourteenth, or beginning of the fifteenth century."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9ee30f2-5657-4025-958f-fb7e679b5eea",
                                                "sense_id": "06e51e09-b8bb-3137-aec8-2e3cdfbfdb96",
                                                "text": "[T]he present research also made an effort to approach a greater accuracy in presenting the original sources of borrowed words. This was achieved by presenting etymons from Hindustani in the Devanagari script followed by a transliteration in the Roman alphabet in parentheses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2842b188-8020-3a4e-9680-5736958a21d8",
                                        "entry_id": "51d8ab5f-448d-3d45-ab21-48ca146d6d60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A digression; the use of such digressions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "rhetoric",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c923facb-901f-46af-95bd-3839c7678266",
                                                "sense_id": "2842b188-8020-3a4e-9680-5736958a21d8",
                                                "text": "Mr. Trevanion was one of those talkers, who are too much engrossed with their own subject matter to have much attention to bestow elsewhere; with them silence is attention. Ethel's wandering eye, and lip, tremulous with its effort to speak, would never have attracted his notice. To his utter astonishment, she interrupted a parenthesis, as brilliant as the rocket which it depicted, by saying,—\n\"Mr. Trevanion, I do not know what you will think of my boldness, but I must speak to you.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b09b7d4b-84fd-40a5-b78b-e31ba263cff0",
                                                "sense_id": "2842b188-8020-3a4e-9680-5736958a21d8",
                                                "text": "Ryan Bingham (George Clooney): I thought I was a part of your life.\nAlex Goran (Vera Farmiga): I thought we signed up for the same thing[…] I thought our relationship was perfectly clear. You are an escape. You're a break from our normal lives. You're a parenthesis.\nRyan Bingham (George Clooney): I'm a parenthesis?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "275a4f28-4828-3164-b7ca-e327b3d735cf",
                                        "entry_id": "51d8ab5f-448d-3d45-ab21-48ca146d6d60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Such brackets as used to clarify expressions by grouping those terms affected by a common operator, or to enclose the components of a vector or the elements of a matrix."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db10f7a5-3956-462e-b975-e7afe763e30b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e6d5bd08-3a48-3696-8555-c46166efefc7",
                        "target_lang_word": "parenthèse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "parenthèse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b200783b-bf8a-334f-a142-b914fe224dde",
                                        "entry_id": "fa58f9d9-5d7a-3732-84be-0930134ff459",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Remarque accessoire formant un sens distinct et séparé de celui de la phrase où elle est insérée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b9cc014-c0ad-44bd-a72b-a1926d51289e",
                                                "sense_id": "b200783b-bf8a-334f-a142-b914fe224dde",
                                                "text": "La parenthèse ou dialyse interrompt le sens d’une phrase par une autre phrase qu’elle jette au milieu […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8364973-0818-4f53-bfd9-0882a1aa8e2e",
                                                "sense_id": "b200783b-bf8a-334f-a142-b914fe224dde",
                                                "text": "Longue parenthèse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bbc6fcf-a0bc-4187-9df1-b86b1395669d",
                                                "sense_id": "b200783b-bf8a-334f-a142-b914fe224dde",
                                                "text": "Ne faites point de parenthèse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73172197-c4a4-447e-96ad-60ca1beaf569",
                                                "sense_id": "b200783b-bf8a-334f-a142-b914fe224dde",
                                                "text": "Cela soit dit par parenthèse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e057be4-b141-304b-a932-9cd169c0dbaf",
                                        "entry_id": "fa58f9d9-5d7a-3732-84be-0930134ff459",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Signes dont on se sert dans l’écriture et dans l’imprimerie pour enfermer les mots d’une parenthèse et qui sont ainsi figurés ( )."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a0ff8e0-8016-4298-a32f-67a0eee53714",
                                                "sense_id": "6e057be4-b141-304b-a932-9cd169c0dbaf",
                                                "text": "Mettre une phrase entre deux parenthèses, entre parenthèses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b851c9db-f5f2-4db8-bdbd-83931a1bc736",
                                                "sense_id": "6e057be4-b141-304b-a932-9cd169c0dbaf",
                                                "text": "Ouvrir la parenthèse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f252b580-819f-4092-a4e0-24511b345950",
                                                "sense_id": "6e057be4-b141-304b-a932-9cd169c0dbaf",
                                                "text": "Fermer la parenthèse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "985f1a5a-14e3-3d06-9a13-a9b7ca9ba2ec",
                                        "entry_id": "fa58f9d9-5d7a-3732-84be-0930134ff459",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Digression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a96f1c6-debe-4f53-9dcd-3d9b85b7174b",
                                                "sense_id": "985f1a5a-14e3-3d06-9a13-a9b7ca9ba2ec",
                                                "text": "C’est confusément que je m’en souviens de cette grand’mère, car sa mort est survenue peu après ce jour. Et comme je ne rencontrerai même plus guère son image vivante dans le cours de ces notes, je vais ouvrir ici une parenthèse pour elle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98410945-d975-446c-8701-5756a10ab0a5",
                                                "sense_id": "985f1a5a-14e3-3d06-9a13-a9b7ca9ba2ec",
                                                "text": "Pendant un exposé de la situation, il ouvre une parenthèse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62ba3f49-444b-4891-924b-a60f3b2ef153",
                                                "sense_id": "985f1a5a-14e3-3d06-9a13-a9b7ca9ba2ec",
                                                "text": "Comment donner aux Français le sentiment qu’ils seront désormais écoutés ? Que le grand débat ne sera pas une parenthèse vite oubliée dans la vie du pays ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ac9d937-5456-33f4-9915-5ff1c929873a",
                                        "entry_id": "fa58f9d9-5d7a-3732-84be-0930134ff459",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moment marquant le début d'une durée finie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05023d67-6cdf-4ca2-a099-83c4b9ca7dbe",
                                                "sense_id": "8ac9d937-5456-33f4-9915-5ff1c929873a",
                                                "text": "Il est cinq heures du matin. Le jour se lève sur la campagne, d'un vert ardent. Ma fille, naissante, termine sa nuit à cette heure secrète, dans la parenthèse du jour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b08b66cb-500a-3543-90ca-82230c4fc237",
                                        "entry_id": "fa58f9d9-5d7a-3732-84be-0930134ff459",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce que l'on fait entre deux activités."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b81df57-1953-49b0-b1fd-3ff5dc1481d1",
                                                "sense_id": "b08b66cb-500a-3543-90ca-82230c4fc237",
                                                "text": "Dans cet interminable combat que fut la remise en état de cette maison, il représenta une parenthèse enchantée, un moment de civilisation dans une arène regorgeant de barbares."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ecd4efa-bdf5-4c01-b4bd-417504e48319",
                                                "sense_id": "b08b66cb-500a-3543-90ca-82230c4fc237",
                                                "text": "J’étais quoi pour lui ? Une friandise ? Une parenthèse ? Un foyer d’accueil ouvert H24 pour obsédé sexuel ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a85b6ce-f8cf-41bd-99ad-96b398c12bea",
                                                "sense_id": "b08b66cb-500a-3543-90ca-82230c4fc237",
                                                "text": "Le pont sera finalement construit à Tancarville pour un certain nombre de raisons techniques : […].\nEn raison de la parenthèse imposée par la seconde guerre mondiale, le pont ne sera finalement mis en service qu’en 1959."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
